{"blocks": [{"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202510/mobKXDnuc.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202510/mobuhA3Qi.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202510/mobQYxhWi.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "…13th"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/hBfDlIN0WtI\nUnhappy birthday構文"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/gQ7l_hav-bA\nAlter ego"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/aQ1iXj4oXfI\n木枯らしは泣かない"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "10月 29日  13th シングル\n「Unhappy birthday構文」　本日発売日です。\nいつも応援してくださり、\nありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202510/mobmeahY2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202510/mobqaaZbp.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "加入して10回目の制作活動でした\n10回！　まだ10回　もう10回。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "制作期間は自分ともグループとも\n向き合う時間が多いので\n色々とコントロールするのが大変です。\n曲や振り付けをいただいて、\nああ好きだな　と思っても\n自分が歌って踊ると違うなあって。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でも皆さんの元に届くまでには\n大体好きになれています !\nプロモーション期間が始まると\nまた違う課題が出てくるんですけどね。\n課題は尽きません…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "毎シングルたくさんの課題を抱えて\n丁寧に頑張っています。\n櫻坂がだいすきなのでね\nもっと頑張りたい~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202510/mobuCkzsh.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先輩が撮ってくださったわたし"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202510/mobEoHFaV.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わたしが撮った同期"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202510/mobxWKa2K.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202510/mob2wkSWf.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "マネージャーさんが撮ってくださったわたし達"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Unhappy birthday構文\nAlter ego\n木枯らしは泣かない\n青空が見えるまで\nI will be\n夜空で一番輝いてる星の名前を僕は知らない\nBuddies (English version)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大切にしたい曲がまた増えました\nどれも素敵な楽曲なので、\n是非きいてみてください~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202510/mobyaRAjC.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日発売日ということで、\n先程SHIBUYA TSUTAYA さんに行ってきました\n皆さんも是非！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、\nCDTV ライブ! ライブ!\nvenue101\n出演させていただきました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202510/mobx19fSE.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "撮ってもらった\n石森璃花さんが撮ってくれました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "新しいカメラを買ったんです。\nそのカメラで歌番組の空き時間に\nメンバーを撮らせていただいたから\nどこかに載せたいのだけど、\nどこに載せたらいいですかね…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログか、\nブログに載せます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そいえば\nフィルムカメラ現像し忘れていました\nしに行ったらそれも載せますね\n年内に載せます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "発売日のブログなのにこうやって関係ない話を長々と書いてしまいした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もっと需要のある深い内容書いた方が良いのにね\n曲とかMVの事になると言葉が詰まります\nこれ逃げですね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからも逃げます\nよろしくお願いします"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お知らせ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "11/8 〜11/30\n新参者"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「新参者」\n懐かしい響きです\n楽しいも苦しいも嬉しいも逃げたいも、\nぜーんぶが詰まった空間でした\nhttps://youtu.be/8Bk_BKNpUN4?si=sRy2PZJdOLOdVr1x\n告知動画かっこいいので是非。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "12/9  12/10\n13th Single BACKS LIVE!!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "12/16  12/17\nBuddies感謝祭 2025 EX"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "開催が決定しました。\n会場でお待ちしております！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "村山美羽"}], "source": "official"}